WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.890 --> 00:00:07.540
Speaker 1: In the other covid related news,
there are states out there who aren't relying

00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:14.170
on the goodwill of people with no goodwill
to get vaccinated.

00:00:14.170 --> 00:00:20.009
We're seeing spikes in all across the country,
in Louisiana and Arkansas, Florida, Texas,

00:00:20.009 --> 00:00:23.590
where we thought we were, we had a stranglehold
on this thing.

00:00:23.590 --> 00:00:26.680
We thought the worst days were behind us.

00:00:26.680 --> 00:00:32.489
And Florida's infection rate right now is
approaching the highest levels of the entire

00:00:32.489 --> 00:00:34.180
pandemic.

00:00:34.180 --> 00:00:38.510
Child hospitalization rates are raising.

00:00:38.510 --> 00:00:45.760
It is it is a worrying specter all across
the country, but in certain states, it's worse

00:00:45.760 --> 00:00:50.940
in my home state of California, not my home
state, but where I live right now, they are

00:00:50.940 --> 00:00:52.340
taking action.

00:00:52.340 --> 00:00:57.460
They are mandating now it was just just announced
they are mandating vaccines for health care

00:00:57.460 --> 00:00:58.629
workers.

00:00:58.629 --> 00:01:02.769
Reading from the L.A. Times, California health
care workers must be vaccinated by the end

00:01:02.769 --> 00:01:07.689
of September under new health order in what
officials characterized as the first requirement

00:01:07.689 --> 00:01:09.439
of its kind in the nation.

00:01:09.439 --> 00:01:14.650
California ordered Thursday that health care
workers statewide must be fully vaccinated

00:01:14.650 --> 00:01:17.390
against covid-19 come early fall.

00:01:17.390 --> 00:01:23.120
The new mandate applies to employees and hospitals,
skilled nursing facilities, clinics, doctors

00:01:23.120 --> 00:01:29.520
offices, hospice facilities, dialysis centers
and most other health care settings and stipulates

00:01:29.520 --> 00:01:33.160
that they complete their inoculation regimen
by September 30th.

00:01:33.160 --> 00:01:38.049
Quote here from an official As we continue
to see an increase in cases and hospitalizations

00:01:38.049 --> 00:01:40.740
due to the Delta variant of covid-19.

00:01:40.740 --> 00:01:44.490
It's important that we protect the vulnerable
patients in these settings.

00:01:44.490 --> 00:01:50.200
Dr. Thomas, Oregon State public health officer
and director of the California Department

00:01:50.200 --> 00:01:51.850
of Public Health, said in a statement.

00:01:51.850 --> 00:01:58.670
Today's action will also ensure that health
care workers themselves are protected.

00:01:58.670 --> 00:02:03.259
Vaccines are how we end this pandemic.

00:02:03.259 --> 00:02:05.119
Reasonable.

00:02:05.119 --> 00:02:12.200
This is a reasonable approach and expected
approach, which is miles apart.

00:02:12.200 --> 00:02:20.910
It is an alternate universe here in California,
leadership wise relative to Florida.

00:02:20.910 --> 00:02:27.600
Or Arkansas, I know the Ferren cousins talked
about it the other day about Asa Hutchinson,

00:02:27.600 --> 00:02:34.150
the former senator and now governor of Arkansas,
who's like, oh, I made a huge mistake, y'all.

00:02:34.150 --> 00:02:39.569
I shouldn't have signed the ban on Marzook
mandates because now people are dying all

00:02:39.569 --> 00:02:40.819
around me.

00:02:40.819 --> 00:02:45.159
All my constituents are in a in bad shape.

00:02:45.159 --> 00:02:49.280
States like that, rules like that don't apply
in certain states.

00:02:49.280 --> 00:02:51.510
California being one of them.

00:02:51.510 --> 00:02:55.640
It was just last week the governor, Gavin
Newsom, announced that California health care

00:02:55.640 --> 00:03:00.860
employees would soon either have to show proof
of their vaccination status or be subjected

00:03:00.860 --> 00:03:02.610
to regular testing.

00:03:02.610 --> 00:03:07.880
The new order largely removes the testing
option and allows only limited religious or

00:03:07.880 --> 00:03:11.239
medical exemptions from the vaccine requirement.

00:03:11.239 --> 00:03:15.989
Employees who are exempted would have to be
tested regularly twice a week if they work

00:03:15.989 --> 00:03:21.819
in acute or long term care facilities and
once a week in other health care settings.

00:03:21.819 --> 00:03:26.730
Unvaccinated employees would also have to
wear a surgical mask or respirator, such as

00:03:26.730 --> 00:03:30.350
in in ninety five while inside a facility.

00:03:30.350 --> 00:03:36.569
All of these are reasonable expectations of
the entire populace, but of course they're

00:03:36.569 --> 00:03:41.160
reasonable for someone working in a health
care setting.

00:03:41.160 --> 00:03:49.300
It is disgraceful the manner with which certain
municipalities, certain states.

00:03:49.300 --> 00:03:55.319
Have dealt with this, which is to say not
dealing with it.

00:03:55.319 --> 00:03:58.830
To act like this is a liberty issue.

00:03:58.830 --> 00:04:05.659
Is nonsense, as I've talked about, if you
choose not to wear a seat belt, you're only

00:04:05.659 --> 00:04:08.430
harming yourself.

00:04:08.430 --> 00:04:14.330
If you choose not to wear a helmet on a motorcycle,
really, it's it just you that you're going

00:04:14.330 --> 00:04:15.730
to harm.

00:04:15.730 --> 00:04:19.330
This is not the case with the coronavirus.

00:04:19.330 --> 00:04:24.660
If I'm not vaccinated, I am and I have been
for months, but if I'm not and I'm walking

00:04:24.660 --> 00:04:30.500
around asymptomatic, just breathe in my filth
all over everybody and I get somebody sick

00:04:30.500 --> 00:04:35.610
and they die, that's on me.

00:04:35.610 --> 00:04:42.080
It's not about my liberty when I infect someone
and they die and I have encroached upon their

00:04:42.080 --> 00:04:44.000
rights.

00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:50.500
It's not wearing a helmet, it's not wearing
a seatbelt, it's not much more liberty, all

00:04:50.500 --> 00:04:52.820
has nothing to do with that.

00:04:52.820 --> 00:04:57.100
It is basic decency and the protection of
our neighbors.

